WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand tall and shift into the left foot.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Place the right ankle above the left knee.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Sit the hips back slightly like Chair Pose.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the chest lifted; press the right knee gently open.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
